<style>
  .we-care-hero { background: var(--blush); padding: 56px 40px; text-align: center; border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border); }
  .we-care-hero h1 { font-family: var(--font-serif); font-size: clamp(36px, 4vw, 56px); font-weight: 300; }
  .we-care-hero h1 em { font-style: italic; color: var(--gold); }

  .care-intro { max-width: 720px; margin: 0 auto; padding: 64px 40px 48px; text-align: center; }
  .care-intro .eyebrow { font-size: 11px; letter-spacing: 3px; text-transform: uppercase; color: var(--gold); font-weight: 500; margin-bottom: 14px; display: block; }
  .care-intro h2 { font-family: var(--font-serif); font-size: clamp(28px, 3.5vw, 42px); font-weight: 300; margin-bottom: 24px; }
  .care-intro h2 em { font-style: italic; }
  .care-intro p { font-size: 15px; color: var(--mid-grey); line-height: 1.9; }

  .divider-line { border: none; border-top: 1px solid var(--border); margin: 0 40px; }

  .causes { padding: 64px 40px 80px; max-width: 1200px; margin: 0 auto; }
  .causes-grid { display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(2, 1fr); gap: 2px; background: var(--border); }
  .cause-card { background: var(--white); padding: 48px 40px; }
  .cause-logo { height: 56px; display: flex; align-items: center; margin-bottom: 24px; }
  .cause-logo img { max-height: 48px; max-width: 160px; object-fit: contain; }
  .cause-number { font-family: var(--font-serif); font-size: 48px; font-weight: 300; color: rgba(156,128,96,0.15); line-height: 1; margin-bottom: 8px; }
  .cause-card h3 { font-family: var(--font-serif); font-size: 26px; font-weight: 400; margin-bottom: 8px; }
  .cause-card h3 em { font-style: italic; }
  .cause-tagline { font-size: 11px; letter-spacing: 2px; text-transform: uppercase; color: var(--gold); font-weight: 500; margin-bottom: 16px; }
  .cause-card > p:last-child { font-size: 14px; color: var(--mid-grey); line-height: 1.9; }

  .commitment { background: var(--charcoal); color: var(--white); padding: 72px 40px; text-align: center; }
  .commitment h2 { font-family: var(--font-serif); font-size: clamp(28px, 3.5vw, 48px); font-weight: 300; margin-bottom: 14px; }
  .commitment h2 em { font-style: italic; color: var(--gold); }
  .commitment > p { font-size: 14px; color: rgba(255,255,255,0.6); max-width: 500px; margin: 0 auto 36px; line-height: 1.8; }
  .cta-buttons { display: flex; gap: 12px; justify-content: center; flex-wrap: wrap; }
  .btn-light { display: inline-block; padding: 14px 40px; border: 1px solid var(--white); color: var(--white); font-size: 11px; letter-spacing: 2px; text-transform: uppercase; font-weight: 500; transition: all 0.2s; }
  .btn-light:hover { background: var(--white); color: var(--charcoal); }
  .btn-gold { display: inline-block; padding: 14px 40px; background: var(--gold); color: var(--white); font-size: 11px; letter-spacing: 2px; text-transform: uppercase; font-weight: 500; transition: background 0.2s; }
  .btn-gold:hover { background: #8a7054; }

  @media (max-width: 768px) {
    .we-care-hero { padding: 40px 20px; }
    .care-intro { padding: 48px 20px 32px; }
    .divider-line { margin: 0 20px; }
    .causes { padding: 40px 20px 60px; }
    .causes-grid { grid-template-columns: 1fr; }
    .cause-card { padding: 32px 24px; }
    .commitment { padding: 56px 20px; }
  }
</style>

<div class="we-care-hero">
  <h1>We <em>Care</em></h1>
</div>

<div class="care-intro">
  <span class="eyebrow">Our Commitment</span>
  <h2>Crafting a Legacy of <em>Compassion</em></h2>
  <p>Melia Nae is not only dedicated to creating timeless jewellery — we are equally committed to making a positive impact on the world around us. We have established a tradition of regular donations to several reputable organisations, because we believe that business can and should be a force for good.</p>
</div>

<hr class="divider-line" />

<div class="causes">
  <div class="causes-grid">
    <div class="cause-card">
      <p class="cause-number">01</p>
      <h3>Cancer <em>Council</em></h3>
      <p class="cause-tagline">A Beacon of Hope</p>
      <p>Melia Nae recognises the importance of supporting initiatives that work towards a cancer-free future. We consistently donate a percentage of our profits to the Cancer Council, aiding in research, prevention, and support for those affected by cancer.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="cause-card">
      <p class="cause-number">02</p>
      <h3>Red <em>Cross</em></h3>
      <p class="cause-tagline">Giving the Gift of Life</p>
      <p>Our commitment to giving back extends to the health and well-being of our community. Melia Nae proudly partners with the Red Cross, actively encouraging and facilitating blood donations among our staff and customers.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="cause-card">
      <p class="cause-number">03</p>
      <h3>Save the <em>Children</em></h3>
      <p class="cause-tagline">Investing in Tomorrow</p>
      <p>Children are the future, and Melia Nae is dedicated to securing a brighter tomorrow. Regular contributions are made to Save the Children, an organisation focused on providing education, healthcare, and safety to children in need.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="cause-card">
      <p class="cause-number">04</p>
      <h3>Beyond <em>Blue</em></h3>
      <p class="cause-tagline">Nurturing Mental Health</p>
      <p>Mental health is a priority for Melia Nae. By supporting Beyond Blue — an organisation dedicated to promoting mental health and providing support for those affected — Melia Nae strives to contribute to a healthier, more connected community.</p>
    </div>
  </div>
</div>

<div class="commitment">
  <h2>Jewellery That Gives <em>Back</em></h2>
  <p>Every purchase you make with Melia Nae contributes to causes that matter. Thank you for being part of our community.</p>
  <div class="cta-buttons">
    <a href="/collections/all" class="btn-light">Shop All Jewellery</a>
    <a href="/pages/about" class="btn-gold">Our Story</a>
  </div>
</div>
